Content":[{"type":"text","text":"A Boolean value indicating whether this clef appears after the barline rather than before it, as for cues or after a repeated section."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"isAfterBarline"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For most elements, any program will compute a default x and y position. The position attributes let this be changed two ways."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"position"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The font attribute group gathers together attributes for determining the font within a credit or direction. They are based on the text styles for Cascading Style Sheets. The font-family is a comma-separated list of font names. The font-style can be normal or italic. The font-size can be one of the CSS sizes or a numeric point size. The font-weight can be normal or bold. The default is application-dependent, but is a text font vs. a music font."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"font"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The color attribute group indicates the color of an element."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"color"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A Boolean value indicating whether to print an object (e.g. a note or a rest). Defaults to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":" if not specified."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"printsObject"}],"kind":"parameters"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLClef\/init(id:content:number:isAdditional:size:isAfterBarline:position:font:color:printsObject:)"},"metadata":{"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:7IvorMXL7MXLClefV2id7content6number12isAdditional4size0G12AfterBarline8position4font5color12printsObjectACSSSg_AC7ContentVAA14MXLStaffNumberVSgSbSgAA13MXLSymbolSizeOSgAtA11MXLPositionVAA7MXLFontVAA8MXLColorVSgATtcfc","symbolKind":"init","roleHeading":"Initializer","title":"init(id:content:number:isAdditional:size:isAfterBarline:positio